The bare oracle loop is still on the first `easy` call; there are no API errors or partial verdicts yet. The hardening script uses long reasoning budgets and only prints after each vendor response, so I’m leaving its transcript ownership untouched and monitoring it in place.
diff --git a/gen_1901_09349.py b/gen_1901_09349.py
